        "Siraya Tech Fibreheart PET-CF.\n\nVendor spec (TDS): density 1.3 g/cm3, nozzle 280-320C, bed 60-80C, cooling fan OFF, print speed 30-120 mm/s, max volumetric 20 mm3/s at 320C, retraction 1-3mm at 1800-3600 mm/min. Requires hardened steel or better nozzle -- Voron has a Diamondback 0.4mm.\n\nThis profile exists to run the calibration tests. UNCALIBRATED: flow ratio (1.0), max volumetric speed (10), pressure advance (0.04), retraction (machine default). Order: temp tower, flow ratio, PA, max flowrate, retraction. Copy results back into 'PET-CF @Voron.ini' on the PrusaSlicer side.\n\nThe 20 mm3/s vendor figure assumes a large nozzle; expect 10-14 through a 0.4mm."
